g n)^2/\\sqrt{\\log n}$, whose factor exceeds $1$ for every\n$50 \\le n < e^{5504}$, so the verified guarantee is weaker than the trivial\n$2^n \\cdot \\mathrm{poly}$ guarantee at every practical size; the machine's\nrunning time is unknown because the constants are never computed; the\nmanuscript's sharper exponents are unverified; the statement does refute\nETH; the audit found no flaw.}\n\\end{abstract}\n\n\\input{sec1_intro}\n\\input{sec2_statement}\n\\input{sec3_beyond}\n\\input{sec4_proof}\n\\input{sec5_replay}\n\\input{sec6_consequences}\n\\input{sec7_practitioner}\n\\input{sec8_lean}\n\\input{sec9_related}\n\\input{sec10_conclusion}\n\\input{sec11_data}\n\\input{sec12_ack}\n\n\\bibliography{refs}\n\n\\begin{appendices}\n\\input{secA_appendix_lean}\n\\end{appendices}\n\n\\end{document}\n# Builds paper3/latex/main.pdf — paper 3 (title fixed by the owner, verbatim in main.tex).\n#   make          latexmk -pdf (pdflatex + bibtex as often as needed)\n#   make check    fail on undefined references or citations in the last build\n#   make clean    remove build products but the PDF\n# Figures are produced by the scripts under ../scripts/ into figures/;\n# tables likewise into tables/ (item 02 and item 06 write them).\nall: main.pdf\n\nmain.pdf: main.tex $(wildcard sec*.tex) refs.bib $(wildcard tables/*.tex) $(wildcard figures/*.pdf)\n\tlatexmk -pdf -interaction=nonstopmode -halt-on-error main.tex\n\ncheck: main.pdf\n\t@! grep -E \"undefined|Citation .* undefined|Reference .* undefined\" main.log\n\t@echo \"no undefined references; $$(pdfinfo main.pdf | grep Pages)\"\n\nclean:\n\tlatexmk -c\n\trm -f *.bbl *.blg *.synctex.gz\n\ndistclean: clean\n\trm -f main.pdf\n\n.PHONY: all check clean distclean","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_0115ShhXDuf1GuBMVUBVEJTx","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
